# 🎛️ Autonomous Fleet Controller (`pat333-cli`)

> **Governing Authority:** Governing Officer Tarwater  
> **Control Plane:** Governed under `autonomous-governance-core`

## Overview
`autonomous-fleet-controller` is the master command-line interface and executive synchronization bus for your complete 7-repository autonomous software ecosystem. It provides global fleet status checks, synchronized workflow patrols, and instantaneous ecosystem-wide kill-switch propagation.
